# Build context for backend/Dockerfile (context = repository root).
# Whitelist: ignore everything, then allow only what the API image copies. Data, model
# weights (mounted at run time), .env, .git, node_modules and reports other than the
# threshold file can therefore never enter the context.
*
!config.yaml
!backend/
!ml/
!reports/classification_metrics.json

# Never needed in the image, even inside allowed folders.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
backend/Dockerfile
